dev_notes/

# Large real-data 2D map test datasets — too big for git (several are
# 100+ MB, over or right at GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit). Hosted as
# assets on a GitHub Release instead; downloaded on demand via
# Help -> Test datasets -> Real (measured) -> Download large test
# datasets... (see LARGE_TEST_DATASETS in src/views/main_window.py and
# resources/test_data/real/README.md). Bundled directly for installer
# builds, so this only affects running from source.
resources/test_data/real/Bigelowiella.mat
resources/test_data/real/Cryptomonas.mat
resources/test_data/real/Eimeria.mat
resources/test_data/real/Gefionella.mat
resources/test_data/real/Glenodinium.mat
resources/test_data/real/Klebsormidium.mat
resources/test_data/real/Microchloropsis.mat
resources/test_data/real/Naegleria.mat
resources/test_data/real/Penium.mat
resources/test_data/real/Schizochytrium.mat
resources/test_data/real/Tetraselmis.mat
